{#
  What happens after someone sends the form: three short promises. Shared
  by /contact/ (contact-section.njk) and the homepage (home/close.njk) so
  the two never say different things.
#}
<div class="next">
  <div class="next-item">
    <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-mail"/></svg>
    <div>
      <h3>I reply within one business day</h3>
      <p>With any questions, and my recommended setup.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="next-item">
    <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clipboard"/></svg>
    <div>
      <h3>I review the project</h3>
      <p>I read what you sent and work out what the project has to do.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="next-item">
    <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield-check"/></svg>
    <div>
      <h3>A clear quote and next steps</h3>
      <p>The price and scope, agreed with you before any work starts.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
